# ═══ Layer 0: 错误面 (Error Surface) ═══
# trigger_tool: 出错的工具 (configure/cmake/meson/make/gcc/clang/ld/python/pip/install/test/runtime)
# phase:         出错阶段 (configuration/compilation/linking/installation/testing/runtime)
# error_signature: 正则表达式(|分隔), 用于精确匹配日志文本
id:                     E1634
trigger_tool: python|unittest|nose|conan
phase: testing
error_signature: unittest discover: Ran [0-9]+ tests.*OK \(skipped=[0-9]+\) while the upstream suite is larger|generator test_.* yielded nothing|plain object test class never collected

# ═══ Layer 1: 识别层 (Recognition) ═══
# severity:      3=🔴blocking  2=🟡medium  1=🟢minor  0=✅resolved
# category:      分类标签（受控词表 64 词，逗号分隔，最多 5 个；add/promote 自动归一化）
# prescan_pattern: （可选）预编译源码扫描正则——写入后 PreScanner 运行时自动派生
#                   PSCAN-KB-{id} 规则，无需改 pre-scan-rules.yaml（知识增长即扫描能力增长）
# prescan_globs:   （可选）扫描范围 glob 列表，默认 '*.c, *.h, *.cc, *.cpp, *.sh, Makefile*, *.mk'
# 词表: platform, compat, limitation, detection, hmdfs, ohos, selinux, kernel, portability, libc, musl, posix, syscall, headers, threading, socket, network, build-system, cmake, autotools ...（全表见 scripts/ohc/kb_taxonomy.py）
# match_keywords: 纯文本关键词(逗号分隔), 用于粗筛(固定字符串匹配F)
# title:         简短标题(一句话描述错误模式)
severity:               2
category:               python, conan, testing
match_keywords: unittest discover, nose, generator test, yield, plain object test class, test accounting, dropped cases, MIN_CASES, coverage gate, upstream test total
title: nose-only test shapes are silently dropped by unittest discovery: recovery runner plus a case-count floor and an exact xfail whitelist are required for honest accounting

# ═══ Layer 2: 诊断层 (Diagnosis) ═══
# root_cause:       一句话根因描述(逗号可分行)
# affected_scope:   影响范围
# verification_cmd: 验证诊断是否正确的命令
root_cause: unittest's discovery collects TestCase subclasses and module-level test_* functions only, while nose also collected generator methods (yield) and plain object classes. discovery therefore exits 0 having run a subset, and a report that quotes only "Ran N tests" understates the upstream total. The gap cannot be closed by installing nose: 1.3.7 is Python 2 syntax and raises SyntaxError on import under 3.12, not ModuleNotFoundError.
affected_scope: Any Python package whose upstream suite is nose-driven or mixes generator tests with TestCase classes on a Python 3.12 worker. Verified instance: kitchen 1.2.6 (kitchen3 127 definitions = 101 unittest-visible + 26 nose-only).
verification_cmd: python3 -m unittest discover -s <pkg>/tests -p 'test_*.py' -v  # then the recovery runner: python3 <pkg>/tests/_ohc_extra_upstream_tests.py

# ═══ Layer 3: 方案层 (Solution Space) ★ ═══
# 推荐方案 (priority 越小越优先, 从 1 开始)
rec_priority: 1
rec_approach: shim-plus-recovery-runner-with-case-floor
rec_description: Ship a minimal shim (about 7 assertion helpers plus SkipTest) as a declared patch so the upstream test sources stay untouched, and add a recovery runner as a second declared patch that replays the nose-only definitions in upstream's own invocation style (chdir into the tests directory, relative imports). Give the runner a MIN_CASES floor and a per-entity coverage gate so a silently shrinking generator makes the build fail, and xfail CPython drift with an exact whitelist that was itself reverse-verified (injecting a new failure must make the run exit non-zero).
rec_command: python3 <pkg>/tests/_ohc_extra_upstream_tests.py  # expect: ran=<N> unexpected_failures=0 known_drift=<K>
rec_auto_fix: false
rec_impl:               unittest-discovery-gap-runner  # 内置实现名 (见 DESIGN §5)

# 回退方案 (当推荐方案不可用时尝试)
fallback_priority:      2
fallback_approach:
fallback_description:
fallback_command:
fallback_auto_fix:      false
fallback_impl:

# ★ 禁止策略 (与推荐方案同等重要) ★
# forbid_N_pattern:     正则(|分隔), 匹配则拒绝/警告
# forbid_N_reason:      为什么禁止
# forbid_N_consequence: 违反后的后果
forbid_1_pattern: delete or comment out the dropped tests|report only the unittest count as the upstream total|broad xfail or skip of the whole module|install nose 1.3.7 and assume it works
forbid_1_reason: Each of these turns a real coverage gap into a green build: the dropped cases disappear from the report, and nose 1.3.7 cannot even be imported on 3.12.
forbid_1_consequence: Reviewers see a pass rate that silently omits upstream cases; the same trap reappears in every nose-driven package.
# forbid_2_pattern:
# forbid_2_reason:
# forbid_2_consequence:

